===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|quality}} The quality of being [[absorbent]].
# {{senseid|en|physics}} {{lb|en|physics}} The ratio of the [[absorbance]] or [[optical density]] of a substance to that of a similar body of pure [[solvent]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=1 May 2007|title=Detergent Can Be So Much More|titleurl=http://www.businessweek.com/magazine/content/06_18/b3982087.htm?chan=innovation_branding_top+stories|journal=BusinessWeek|accessdate=9 Feb. 2009
|passage=Product benefits are quickly copied, whether it's cleaning power or diaper '''absorbency'''.}}
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} The action of [[absorb]]ing.

